## Notes: Small goblin conveniences: auto accept and turn in quests, sort and trim the quest tracker, sell junk, repair, train, loot fast, decline duels and guild invites, accept invites from your guild or friends and summons, skip cinematics, zoom the camera out further, read a zone's levels, herbs, ore, fish and skins on the world map, and count the kills to your next level. Time is money, friend.
